\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">throw</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\"> IllegalStateException</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)\">\"炸了\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">) }</span></span></code></pre>",
